In the hall...

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:27.850
...if you hadn't shown up, Mr. Fukuoka
might have returned to normal.

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:31.860
Bancho, let's go!!

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:32.730
Huh?!

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:34.460
To help Rurippe's father!!

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:36.160
Right!

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:39.110
And we are going!

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:47.110
Go, Ukiya!!
Take care of Rurippe's father!

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:56.980
<i>Rurippe.!</i>

00:19:57.060 --> 00:20:00.520
'up- 'up-

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:08.830
Do you intend to save the world by destroying
the invader along with your own father?

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.830
This is why I hate honor students.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:21.180
I want to see how
pathetic you really are!

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:23.220
Your true form!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:35.520
Rurippe!!
Don't worry, your father's all right!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.220
Ukiya...

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:46.640
Your father is all right!! Rurippe!!

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:49.840
Please hit it!!!

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:14.600
<i>Rurippe, I kept my word.</i>

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:17.860
Oh, no!
Ukiya!

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:19.500
Ikusawa and...

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:21.440
...Kurogane...

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.880
...went somewhere!

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:39.450
So she sealed her gate and
locked herself deep inside her own heart...

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:43.720
Excellent, but I want one
more task from you, Megumi.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.970
All right.

00:21:50.940 --> 00:21:55.000
If you promise to truly
acknowledge me...

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:11.060
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:14.930
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:23.280
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:25.410
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:30.580
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:33.920
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:38.550
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:39.260 --> 00:22:43.420
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:48.060
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:48.530 --> 00:22:54.840
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
